(6908838, 1040914, 103032, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top five showing.  One of my higher scores...  Oddly enough, I just noticed the little buttons on the sweater, somehow I was distracted ;)<br/> <br/>Seriously though, as a photographer/artist, I''m glad DPC has gotten you to step out of your comfort zone.  This was tastefully done, well thought out, and appreciated by the people here.  You have a great portfolio.  Cheers.</td>', 'Congrats on a top five showing.  One of my higher scores...  Oddly enough, I just noticed the little buttons on the sweater, somehow I was distracted ;) Seriously though, as a photographer/artist, I''m glad DPC has gotten you to step out of your comfort zone.  This was tastefully done, well thought out, and appreciated by the people here.  You have a great portfolio.  Cheers.', '2012-11-19 04:04:37.000000', NULL, 0),
